     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello NicheMapR peeps,<div>I asked a question for Mike about the equation for correcting location windspeed by a reference windspeed, and he recommended posting the question here so that duplicate questions can be avoided. Here was my question and his answer:</div><div><br></div><div>Hi Mike,<br>What is the equation used to correct wind speed measured at a height to ground level?<br>For example, the wind speed was measured at a height of 10 m, but I want to correct it at ground level (2 cm height).</div><div><br></div><div>Hi Niky,<br>In general, if you have questions that aren’t very specific to a collaborative project, can you post your questions on the google group? That way others can learn too and I might avoid duplicating answers. But to answer your question, have a look through the NicheMapR help, specifically <a href=\"https://mrke.github.io/NicheMapR/inst/doc/microclimate-model-theory-equations\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://mrke.github.io/NicheMapR/inst/doc/microclimate-model-theory-equations&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239957963000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0sjftaiSG80Ez9wCvLSQaO\">https://mrke.github.io/NicheMapR/inst/doc/microclimate-model-theory-equations</a> – worth a general study of this and hopefully you’ll find most of your answers there. You can also see where this is done in micro_global (or any of the other functions):<br><a href=\"https://github.com/mrke/NicheMapR/blob/master/R/micro_global.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/mrke/NicheMapR/blob/master/R/micro_global.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239957963000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1uO0jTowurS6mfYSv_VY33\">https://github.com/mrke/NicheMapR/blob/master/R/micro_global.R</a> (from line 824)<br><br># correct for fact that wind is measured at 10 m height<br># wind shear equation v / vo = (h / ho)^a<br>#where<br>#v = the velocity at height h (m/s)<br>#vo = the velocity at height ho (m/s)<br>#a = the wind shear exponent<br>#Terrain Wind Shear Exponent<br>#- a -<br># Open water 0.1<br>#Smooth, level, grass-covered 0.15 (or more commonly 1/7)<br>#Row crops 0.2<br>#Low bushes with a few trees 0.2<br>#Heavy trees 0.25<br>#Several buildings 0.25<br>#Hilly, mountainous terrain 0.25<br># source <a href=\"http://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/wind-shear-d_1215.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/wind-shear-d_1215.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793239957964000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wFyIWwSUitS5LY467JO_v\">http://www.engineeringtoolbox.com/wind-shear-d_1215.html</a></div><div><br>WNMINN &lt;- WNMINN * (1.2 / 10) ^ 0.15<br>WNMAXX &lt;- WNMAXX * (1.2 / 10) ^ 0.15<br><br></div><div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10pt;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" color=\"#38761d\">Nicholas C. Wu</font></span></b><b style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:7.5pt;color:green;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"> </span></b><font color=\"#444444\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">| </span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">PhD</span></font></p><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Tahoma;font-size:13px\"></span><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><b><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"1\">Postdoctoral Research Fellow</font></span></b><b style=\"font-family:Tahoma;font-size:x-small\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif\"><span></span></span></b></p></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><font color=\"#444444\">Animal Ecology Lab </font><font style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">| </span></font><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Hawkesbury Institute for the Environment</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Western Sydney University</span><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font color=\"#444444\">, </font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">NSW </span><span style=\"border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><font color=\"#595959\">2753 | </font></span><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">Australia</span></font></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68);font-family:&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,sans-serif;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><br></span></p></div>\r\n\r\n<font face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"1\"><span style=\"line-height:107%;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><b style=\"color:rgb(68,68,68)\">E: </b><a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><font color=\"#38761d\">nichola...@gmail.com</font></a> </span><b><span style=\"line-height:13.91px;color:rgb(89,89,89);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">| </span></b><b><span style=\"line-height:13.91px;color:rgb(68,68,68);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">M: </span></b><span style=\"line-height:13.91px;color:rgb(68,68,68);border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><a href=\"tel:+61%20409%20456%20802\" value=\"+61409456802\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">+61 409 456 802</a> </span><b><span style=\"line-height:13.91px;color:rgb(89,89,89);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">| </span></b><b><span style=\"line-height:13.91px;color:rgb(68,68,68);background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\">W: </span></b><u><span style=\"line-height:13.91px;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm;background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-repeat:initial\"><a href=\"http://wunicholas.wix.com/home\" targe